    section.about-team
      .container
        p.about-team__lead The Engine only works because of the specialists behind the wheel. We don’t pass projects off to interns or hide behind account managers. Everyone assigned to your sprint is an active builder.
        ul.about-team__list
          each member in team
            li.about-team__member
              span= member[0]
              span= member[1]
